        "valueString": "No shortness of breath, chest pain, wheeze, haemoptysis, fever, rigors, myalgia, pleuritic chest pain, night sweats, weight loss, or TB contacts. Mild sore throat early in the illness has settled. Energy slightly reduced; appetite okay."
